      "generationBrief": "On a stormy night, a one-armed veteran hunter pushes open the heavy oak door of the Crossing Inn. The hearthfire illuminates a rune-wrapped greatsword at his waist, instantly silencing the boisterous tavern. He sits at the counter and slams a faintly pulsing abyssal dragon scale in front of the innkeeper. 'The beast that devoured the vanguard at Blackridge three years ago has awakened,' the old hunter rasps. 'It is swimming toward the town along the underground aqueduct.' Before his words fade, a deep, ominous scraping sound echoes from the dark drainage channels beneath the floorboards."
